WEBVTT

00:01.668 --> 00:04.337
I'm Nina, 12 years old.

00:04.337 --> 00:08.041
I was just an ordinary
junior high school student, but...

00:08.041 --> 00:11.277
Since the day I accidentally swallowed
a ball called the Crystal Pearl,

00:11.277 --> 00:14.280
my life has changed pretty drastically.

00:14.280 --> 00:19.452
And the ball happened to be something
that's used for the sorcery test.

00:19.452 --> 00:22.255
The team of the two examinees,
which happens to possess that ball

00:22.255 --> 00:24.883
when the test ends, will pass the test
and become professional sorcerers!

00:27.027 --> 00:29.329
Does that mean I'm going to be
chased down by the examinees?!

00:29.329 --> 00:32.232
- Don't cry!
- I guess you have no choice
but to prepare yourself, Zero.

00:32.232 --> 00:33.500
Huh?

00:33.500 --> 00:35.235
There is only one way to do this.

00:35.235 --> 00:36.836
You will have to protect her
with everything you've got

00:36.836 --> 00:39.339
until the day that the test ends.

00:39.339 --> 00:40.640
Until the day the medicine is completed

00:40.640 --> 00:44.210
and you're able to remove
the Crystal Pearl from her body...

00:44.210 --> 00:46.312
We will protect her with our own hands!

00:46.312 --> 00:47.680
You mean her?!

00:47.680 --> 00:51.718
Me? These guys are going to protect me?

00:51.718 --> 00:52.852
Just like the princes

00:52.852 --> 00:55.422
who bravely face the enemies
no matter how ferocious they are

00:55.422 --> 00:58.224
and fight them for the people
that they love and their own dreams...

00:58.224 --> 01:00.988
These two are going to protect me!

01:01.094 --> 01:13.706
One love! Two love? Three love! Four love?
One love! Two love? Three love! Come on!

01:13.706 --> 01:19.979
Here's what boys don't know.
Girls are moody.

01:19.979 --> 01:26.219
You're a sweet person
and it will be okay tomorrow.

01:26.219 --> 01:32.525
But I feel different today.
I want to go all out!

01:32.525 --> 01:38.798
Because I can't decide it just yet
I want everything

01:38.798 --> 01:45.071
The kinds of love are just like jewels.

01:45.071 --> 01:51.344
Each of them (Shining boys!)
is sparkling. Yes!

01:51.344 --> 01:57.650
They say there is only one true love

01:57.650 --> 02:03.957
But it's okay, we can decide
that at the very last moment

02:03.957 --> 02:10.196
That moment (Happiness)
I will protect it (Happiness)

02:10.196 --> 02:16.503
Come on, let's go find a popping heart

02:16.503 --> 02:22.775
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!

02:22.775 --> 02:27.542
My love! True love! Your love!
Pure love! My love! True love!

02:32.819 --> 02:35.155
Geez, I'm late! I'm late!

02:35.155 --> 02:38.158
I can't believe both Zero and Ichii
left for school without me!

02:38.158 --> 02:39.819
They have no heart!

02:47.167 --> 02:49.836
You're hasty, aren't you, little cutie?

02:49.836 --> 02:52.498
You need to pay more attention
at a street corner!

02:56.843 --> 02:58.511
See ya!

02:58.511 --> 02:59.500
Huh?

03:01.848 --> 03:05.181
That guy was kind of cool!

03:09.856 --> 03:11.191
What are you doing, Kuku?

03:11.191 --> 03:12.692
Hey, Toto.

03:12.692 --> 03:15.328
As a person, who wants to
be intelligent and beautiful,

03:15.328 --> 03:17.797
I figured that it's necessary
to be popular with girls!

03:17.797 --> 03:21.534
What are you reading? "100 Pickup Lines
that Make You Popular with Girls"?

03:21.534 --> 03:23.870
I don't think that's exactly
what you need to know though...

03:23.870 --> 03:25.205
More importantly, check this out!

03:25.205 --> 03:28.374
I've finally got the response
of the Crystal Pearl! Look.

03:28.374 --> 03:30.877
It's around here. It's around here.

03:30.877 --> 03:32.538
Good job, Toto!

03:33.546 --> 03:37.283
I see... So he's inside
of this building, huh?

03:37.283 --> 03:38.885
Inside of this!

03:38.885 --> 03:42.021
Hey, Zero, Ichii!
Tell me what's going on!

03:42.021 --> 03:43.223
What do you mean "what's going on?"

03:43.223 --> 03:45.625
Why did you leave for school without me?

03:45.625 --> 03:48.995
Huh? I only left early
because I'm on day duty today.

03:48.995 --> 03:51.064
So you weren't with Zero zura?

03:51.064 --> 03:52.565
No, I wasn't!

03:52.565 --> 03:55.568
It's your fault for
taking forever, you idiot!

03:55.568 --> 03:56.836
What's that supposed to mean?

03:56.836 --> 03:58.404
Idiot! Idiot!

03:58.404 --> 03:59.405
Hey!

03:59.405 --> 04:00.907
Wait, Zero!

04:00.907 --> 04:01.741
- Hey!
- Idiot!

04:01.741 --> 04:04.677
Oh boy... Another peaceful day zura, huh?

04:04.677 --> 04:07.580
Heeeey! Excuse me!

04:07.580 --> 04:09.916
Hey, you're the one from this morning!

04:09.916 --> 04:12.085
Huh? Huh, huh, huh?

04:12.085 --> 04:13.920
What do you know?
You're the cutie from earlier!

04:13.920 --> 04:15.488
Thank you for what happened this morning.

04:15.488 --> 04:16.990
No problem!

04:16.990 --> 04:19.259
I'm just glad that a cutie
like you didn't get hurt!

04:19.259 --> 04:20.760
What...

04:20.760 --> 04:22.528
Were you okay?

04:22.528 --> 04:25.064
Wow, Nina!

04:25.064 --> 04:26.933
- Hey, Nina, what's going on?
- What?

04:26.933 --> 04:27.934
You need to introduce him to us!

04:27.934 --> 04:30.103
This is so not fair! You always
steal the best part, Nina!

04:30.103 --> 04:31.938
It's not like that, Yo-chan, Hatsuka!

04:31.938 --> 04:36.109
This person helped me when
I almost fell this morning, that's all!

04:36.109 --> 04:39.145
But why is that person here?

04:39.145 --> 04:41.613
Actually I'm looking for someone...

04:42.949 --> 04:46.112
Y-You!! What are you doing here?

04:47.320 --> 04:50.290
Zero! I figured that
I'd definitely run into you

04:50.290 --> 04:54.294
if I keep on going after the
Crystal Pearl... I guess I was right.

04:54.294 --> 04:56.296
So that means this person is...

04:56.296 --> 05:00.033
That's right! Examinees #009 and #010!

05:00.033 --> 05:01.834
Kuku and-

05:01.834 --> 05:03.703
Toto!

05:03.703 --> 05:04.704
Huh?

05:04.704 --> 05:07.040
I finally found you, Zero!

05:07.040 --> 05:08.371
Don't you come near me!

05:12.545 --> 05:13.546
You are...

05:13.546 --> 05:15.915
She's a girl zura!!

05:15.915 --> 05:18.718
Zero... Zero...

05:18.718 --> 05:22.055
I'm happy! I see you're finally ready!

05:22.055 --> 05:24.424
- What? No way!
- What? No way!

05:24.424 --> 05:25.792
Get away from me, Kuku!

05:25.792 --> 05:28.795
What's your problem?
Didn't you want to see me naked?

05:28.795 --> 05:30.330
Hell no!

05:30.330 --> 05:31.497
Zero!

05:31.497 --> 05:32.632
Who is she?

05:32.632 --> 05:33.766
Do you know her zura?

05:33.766 --> 05:34.767
Well, that's...

05:34.767 --> 05:37.337
What's going on, Zero?
You still haven't told your friends?

05:37.337 --> 05:39.205
Stop it! Of course I haven't!

05:39.205 --> 05:41.808
Like I said, who is that girl?

05:41.808 --> 05:43.076
I am...

05:43.076 --> 05:43.910
You are...

05:43.910 --> 05:45.178
- You are...
- You are...

05:45.178 --> 05:47.347
His fiancée! Zero's!

05:47.347 --> 05:50.283
What? What?!

05:50.283 --> 05:52.217
Fiancée?

05:52.719 --> 05:55.347
"Here Comes His Fiancée!"

05:58.358 --> 06:00.693
H-Hey, wait a second!
You say you're my fiancée,

06:00.693 --> 06:03.696
but that's something our parents
decided against our will!

06:03.696 --> 06:05.198
So that doesn't mean I am your...

06:05.198 --> 06:06.199
Even if the decision
was made by our parents,

06:06.199 --> 06:08.034
a promise is still a promise!

06:08.034 --> 06:10.870
It's my motto to keep promises
no matter what!

06:10.870 --> 06:15.041
That's why I became an examinee
and followed you to the human world!

06:15.041 --> 06:17.377
What? Give me a break!

06:17.377 --> 06:20.713
Why would I have to marry you?
I'm out of here!

06:20.713 --> 06:23.383
Hey! Are you going to
bail out on me, Zero? Wait!

06:23.383 --> 06:26.052
Hey, Nina! This is a problem!

06:26.052 --> 06:27.387
Now you've got a rival!

06:27.387 --> 06:30.390
What are you going to do? This is
the beginning of another love triangle!

06:30.390 --> 06:32.558
It's not like that at all.

06:32.558 --> 06:35.561
There's nothing going on between
Zero and I, so it's really not my problem.

06:35.561 --> 06:40.066
What? So that means Ichii-kun
is the one you really like?

06:40.066 --> 06:43.403
How did you even reach
that conclusion? Geez!

06:43.403 --> 06:48.074
That's right, I don't care if
Zero has a fiancée.

06:48.074 --> 06:50.065
I don't care!

06:51.077 --> 06:53.079
So why...

06:53.079 --> 06:55.415
Why... Why...

06:55.415 --> 06:57.083
Why...

06:57.083 --> 07:00.075
Why am I so pissed off like this?!

07:00.753 --> 07:05.091
It's strange... It's supposed to work
if I follow what this book says,

07:05.091 --> 07:07.427
so how come Zero wouldn't fall for me?

07:07.427 --> 07:09.762
What are you reading next? Huh?

07:09.762 --> 07:12.754
"100 Things to Know to Become
Your Husband's Ideal Wife"?

07:13.933 --> 07:16.436
Let's not do this anymore, Kuku.
First of all you wouldn't

07:16.436 --> 07:19.439
just marry anyone just
because a promise was made, right?

07:19.439 --> 07:22.775
You should get to know each other first
and care about each other then-

07:22.775 --> 07:26.112
Shut up! If I say I keep a promise,
I keep a promise no matter what!

07:26.112 --> 07:27.113
Kuku...

07:27.113 --> 07:30.116
All right, next is
"sexual charm"! Let's go!

07:30.116 --> 07:32.785
Hey, wait, Kuku!
Don't get so ahead of yourself!

07:32.785 --> 07:35.117
Sheesh... Kuku!

07:37.457 --> 07:38.458
Zero!

07:38.458 --> 07:39.459
Hmm?

07:39.459 --> 07:40.448
What?

07:41.794 --> 07:43.129
What do you think?

07:43.129 --> 07:45.798
Will this work for you?

07:45.798 --> 07:47.800
No, you can't do that! Don't look at her!

07:47.800 --> 07:49.461
What do you think you're doing, Kuku?

07:50.470 --> 07:53.139
Put this on now!
You've gone too far with that!

07:53.139 --> 07:56.809
Geez, why do I have to be so
irritated about him anyway?

07:56.809 --> 07:59.479
I'm going to eat this
special butter cream sandwich

07:59.479 --> 08:02.849
and the orange pastry with red bean and
maple syrup that I bought at the cafeteria,

08:02.849 --> 08:04.476
and forget everything that happened!

08:08.154 --> 08:13.148
Wh-What are you two doing?
Looking like that!

08:14.494 --> 08:17.163
Hey, Nina! I-I can explain...

08:17.163 --> 08:21.167
You jerk! Jerk! What's your problem,
Zero, looking all happy?

08:21.167 --> 08:22.502
I can't believe you!

08:22.502 --> 08:24.837
Zero, you letch!!

08:24.837 --> 08:26.506
Hey, wait, Nina!

08:26.506 --> 08:28.341
Hey, don't you run away from me, Zero!

08:28.341 --> 08:30.510
Hold on, Kuku!

08:30.510 --> 08:31.844
You need to put some clothes on!

08:31.844 --> 08:32.845
Shut up!

08:32.845 --> 08:34.013
Come on!

08:34.013 --> 08:35.348
Zero!

08:35.348 --> 08:37.850
Before you do anything,
you have to put some clothes on!

08:37.850 --> 08:42.655
Kuku, I don't want anyone
to see you looking like that!

08:42.655 --> 08:43.679
I...

08:45.191 --> 08:49.195
I can't... I can't catch up with her...

08:49.195 --> 08:54.534
I wonder why Kuku is always like that...

08:54.534 --> 08:56.525
Maybe I'm just...

08:58.204 --> 09:02.875
Zura... That's how it is zura,
huh... I see...

09:02.875 --> 09:05.545
Toto must...

09:05.545 --> 09:07.213
Cripes! Idiot! Idiot!

09:07.213 --> 09:10.416
This whole time, to me Zero was like...

09:10.416 --> 09:13.553
After all I guess only Nina
can make Nina's smile, huh?

09:13.553 --> 09:18.057
I just can't take it! Whenever I see
you having fun with another guy,

09:18.057 --> 09:19.392
I don't know why, but I feel...

09:19.392 --> 09:23.396
That's what he told me!
Geez, he's such a liar!

09:23.396 --> 09:26.732
Oh, no... Why I am crying?

09:26.732 --> 09:32.572
I shouldn't care if
she's his fiancée, but... Why?

09:32.572 --> 09:34.907
I've had enough of it!

09:34.907 --> 09:40.573
Why am I feeling this pain in my heart?
Why is my heart aching so much?

09:42.582 --> 09:44.250
Nina...

09:44.250 --> 09:46.586
What do you want, Zero?
What are you doing here?

09:46.586 --> 09:52.258
Oh, you scared me for a second.
I thought you were crying.

09:52.258 --> 09:56.596
You... You... Idiot!

09:56.596 --> 09:57.597
What did you do that for?

09:57.597 --> 09:59.932
Not just once, but twice? First of all-

09:59.932 --> 10:02.435
Don't flatter yourself! I wasn't crying!

10:02.435 --> 10:03.603
Huh?

10:03.603 --> 10:05.271
Geez, just leave me alone, Zero!

10:05.271 --> 10:09.775
Why don't you go and be
with your fiancée or whatever?

10:09.775 --> 10:12.938
I can't take it any more!
I hate you, Zero!

10:18.618 --> 10:19.619
You hate me...

10:19.619 --> 10:24.290
Oh, no! I was way out of line...
What should I do?

10:24.290 --> 10:28.227
But... But you know...

10:28.227 --> 10:30.630
I don't hate...

10:30.630 --> 10:32.632
Huh?

10:32.632 --> 10:34.293
I don't hate...

10:35.635 --> 10:38.971
I don't hate you.

10:38.971 --> 10:41.565
You don't hate me?

10:42.642 --> 10:44.310
Zero! Where are you?

10:44.310 --> 10:45.971
Oh, crap!

10:47.313 --> 10:48.981
Right there?

10:48.981 --> 10:49.970
Hey!

10:51.050 --> 10:52.118
Over there, huh, Zero?

10:52.118 --> 10:54.654
Wait! Wait! I will never let you get away!

10:54.654 --> 10:57.657
No matter where you go
I will find you for sure!

10:57.657 --> 10:59.147
No matter where you hide-

11:02.161 --> 11:05.665
Where are you? How could I tell now?

11:05.665 --> 11:07.266
That'll show you!

11:07.266 --> 11:08.668
Don't move, Nina!

11:08.668 --> 11:14.006
"Don't move"? Come on, look at the
situation we're in and how close we are!

11:14.006 --> 11:15.675
This is crazy!

11:15.675 --> 11:18.344
My heart is pounding!

11:18.344 --> 11:20.012
- Zero!
- Be quiet!

11:20.012 --> 11:21.080
Huh?

11:21.080 --> 11:24.684
Whoa! Whoa! Whoa! It feels
like it's going to explode!!

11:24.684 --> 11:26.352
Is it this way?

11:26.352 --> 11:29.689
Good! Is she gone now? Let's get out!

11:29.689 --> 11:32.024
Shoot! She's still there!
Nina, get back! Get back!

11:32.024 --> 11:34.356
I can't! I can't get back! I can't!

11:37.697 --> 11:38.698
Crap!

11:38.698 --> 11:40.029
- Busted?
- Busted?

11:44.370 --> 11:46.372
Wh-Who is that girl, Zero?

11:46.372 --> 11:48.708
Let me guess! You must
be having an affair with her!

11:48.708 --> 11:51.377
I'm not even going out with you, so why
do you call this me having an affair?

11:51.377 --> 11:53.879
Shut up! I will never
forgive you for this!

11:53.879 --> 11:56.382
I will invoke evil
upon you with my magic!!

11:56.382 --> 11:59.374
Tarot magic! Animal Change!

12:03.723 --> 12:05.391
What the...

12:05.391 --> 12:06.726
What is this?

12:06.726 --> 12:09.061
What's going on? Kuku!!

12:09.061 --> 12:11.063
It's animalizing tarot magic!

12:11.063 --> 12:12.732
As you proceed step-by-step

12:12.732 --> 12:14.734
the animalization in your body
gradually progresses!

12:14.734 --> 12:16.902
And once you reach the end of the process

12:16.902 --> 12:19.393
you would not be able to go back to
your normal form for the next 10 years!

12:20.740 --> 12:22.742
- What? 10 years?
- What? 10 years?

12:22.742 --> 12:23.909
But don't you worry!

12:23.909 --> 12:26.412
As for Zero, even after
he becomes a real dog,

12:26.412 --> 12:30.750
I will still take care of him and
train him well, then eventually marry him!

12:30.750 --> 12:34.086
So I suggest you enjoy the
rest of your life as a human

12:34.086 --> 12:35.755
while it still lasts!

12:35.755 --> 12:38.090
There are three more stages
to go until full-animalization!

12:38.090 --> 12:40.926
Three stages, okay! See ya!

12:40.926 --> 12:46.932
What? No way! Three stages left
until we're fully animalized?

12:46.932 --> 12:49.264
- You've got to be kidding me!!
- You've got to be kidding me!!

13:05.785 --> 13:08.788
Sheesh, where did she go?

13:08.788 --> 13:10.790
Kuku! Kuku!

13:10.790 --> 13:12.625
What are you doing zura?

13:12.625 --> 13:14.460
Oh, have you seen Kuku?

13:14.460 --> 13:19.799
No, I haven't seen her zura.
I bet she's chasing Zero again zura!

13:19.799 --> 13:20.800
I guess you're right...

13:20.800 --> 13:23.803
Seriously, you're so pitiful zura.

13:23.803 --> 13:27.306
Toto, are you planning to stay
quiet like this forever zura?

13:27.306 --> 13:29.475
Are you just going to sit around and wait,

13:29.475 --> 13:32.478
not being able to say
what you want to say zura?

13:32.478 --> 13:33.813
What are you talking about?

13:33.813 --> 13:35.648
What am I talking about?

13:35.648 --> 13:39.819
I'm a pro when it comes to romance,
love and relationships,

13:39.819 --> 13:42.488
and I know exactly
what you're thinking zura!

13:42.488 --> 13:45.491
What? No, it's not like Kuku
and I have a relationship like that, so...

13:45.491 --> 13:48.327
No one said anything about Kuku zura.

13:48.327 --> 13:49.495
Zura!

13:49.495 --> 13:52.498
You tricked me, didn't you? I can't
believe you made fun of me like this!

13:52.498 --> 13:54.333
I didn't mean to make fun of you,

13:54.333 --> 13:56.502
but I was so frustrated
to watch you like this zura!

13:56.502 --> 13:59.505
Why don't you tell her how you feel zura?

13:59.505 --> 14:03.342
Because... Zero is whom Kuku likes...

14:03.342 --> 14:05.511
I'm just a childhood friend of hers.

14:05.511 --> 14:07.847
I doubt that I'm more
than just a friend to her...

14:07.847 --> 14:10.008
You're pathetic zura!!

14:11.684 --> 14:12.852
What did you do that for?

14:12.852 --> 14:15.514
Stop mumbling and just go!

14:16.522 --> 14:20.526
Toto, because you're being hesitant,
Kuku looks elsewhere!

14:20.526 --> 14:23.863
She could be misled into thinking
that you're not looking at her!

14:23.863 --> 14:24.864
What...

14:24.864 --> 14:27.199
Go! And give it a try zura!

14:27.199 --> 14:30.202
And if she can't accept
your feelings for her,

14:30.202 --> 14:34.036
then she was just that kind
of person from the get-go zura.

14:35.207 --> 14:39.211
Go for all or nothing zura!
If you have faith in Kuku...

14:39.211 --> 14:40.212
Okay.

14:40.212 --> 14:41.873
Go, young man!

14:42.882 --> 14:44.884
All right! Good luck to you zura!

14:44.884 --> 14:48.581
I did a good thing! Zura, zura!

14:49.488 --> 14:51.223
Like I said, it's not
going to work, Nina!

14:51.223 --> 14:52.892
- Medicine... Medicine... Medicine...
- Trying to find it in the
magic world is one thing,

14:52.892 --> 14:54.894
- Medicine... Medicine... Medicine...
- but there's no way you could find
the medicine to remove this spell

14:54.894 --> 14:56.228
in the human world!

14:56.228 --> 14:58.564
But doing nothing
won't solve the problem!

14:58.564 --> 15:01.233
I absolutely refuse to do nothing
and become a squirrel!

15:01.233 --> 15:03.235
Of course I don't want
that to happen either...

15:03.235 --> 15:06.572
But you know, there's no way
some medicine for humans could fix this.

15:06.572 --> 15:08.240
It's not like this is
a simple cold or anything...

15:08.240 --> 15:10.910
The TV show last night was so funny,
wasn't it? Did you watch it?

15:10.910 --> 15:12.901
- I did!
- Come on! This way.

15:13.913 --> 15:16.916
It should be fine
if we keep the curtain closed.

15:16.916 --> 15:17.917
I guess so.

15:17.917 --> 15:20.252
But this is, in a way-

15:20.252 --> 15:21.587
What?

15:21.587 --> 15:23.589
A closed room...

15:23.589 --> 15:26.251
- Huh? Is someone in there?
- Sensei!

15:29.929 --> 15:30.930
What's the matter?
Have you gotten a cold?

15:30.930 --> 15:37.303
Oh, well, I was... having some headaches,
so is it okay if I sleep for a while?

15:37.303 --> 15:40.940
I see. Take care. Get some rest.

15:40.940 --> 15:45.110
Oh, one more thing. I'll step out for
a bit, but will you be okay by yourself?

15:45.110 --> 15:47.947
Y-Yes! I'll be perfectly fine!

15:47.947 --> 15:49.949
I don't care! Just hurry up and go!

15:49.949 --> 15:51.610
See you later.

15:58.958 --> 15:59.959
I-I'm sorry!

15:59.959 --> 16:01.961
No...

16:01.961 --> 16:04.964
I-I'm fine...

16:04.964 --> 16:06.632
Anyway-

16:06.632 --> 16:10.302
What do we have to do
to go back to normal?

16:10.302 --> 16:12.972
I don't want to stay as
an animal for the next 10 years.

16:12.972 --> 16:15.975
If I remember correctly,
the last time our bodies switched,

16:15.975 --> 16:19.979
we had to hold each other and unify our
hearts to put everything back to normal.

16:19.979 --> 16:24.984
We held each other
and unified our hearts...

16:24.984 --> 16:26.652
You're right.

16:26.652 --> 16:29.989
So why don't we try to
do the same thing again?

16:29.989 --> 16:30.990
What?

16:30.990 --> 16:32.992
If we hold each other again and try
to bring our hearts closer together,

16:32.992 --> 16:33.993
we might be able to go back to normal.

16:33.993 --> 16:35.984
Right...

16:36.495 --> 16:42.593
"Da-bump Da-bump Da-bump
Da-bump Da-bump"

16:55.014 --> 16:58.017
It didn't work! If that
didn't turn us back to normal...

16:58.017 --> 16:59.018
Then next we have to-

16:59.018 --> 17:00.686
- Kiss?
- Kiss?

17:00.686 --> 17:02.017
What...

17:05.691 --> 17:08.027
There's no way that
we would go that far, right?

17:08.027 --> 17:09.695
Yeah, exactly!

17:09.695 --> 17:10.696
But you know,

17:10.696 --> 17:14.366
if we didn't do anything about it
we'd only end up turning into animals,

17:14.366 --> 17:16.368
so maybe we should try to...

17:16.368 --> 17:17.036
Kiss?

17:17.036 --> 17:18.037
What?

17:18.037 --> 17:20.039
H-How could I even k-kiss you
when we're not even sure

17:20.039 --> 17:22.041
if that's going to turn us back to normal?

17:22.041 --> 17:24.032
That was just a joke!

17:25.044 --> 17:26.712
Sorry.

17:26.712 --> 17:28.380
Oh, that was just a joke, huh?

17:28.380 --> 17:32.718
I'm sorry for
making you uncomfortable, Nina.

17:32.718 --> 17:34.049
Sorry.

17:35.721 --> 17:39.391
No, that's not what I meant.

17:39.391 --> 17:43.395
It wasn't like I didn't want to...

17:43.395 --> 17:44.726
I...

17:47.066 --> 17:48.067
Go ahead.

17:48.067 --> 17:50.069
What?

17:50.069 --> 17:53.739
You can go ahead.

17:53.739 --> 17:55.407
You can kiss me.

17:55.407 --> 17:56.742
B-But...

17:56.742 --> 17:59.711
Go ahead. It could turn us
back to normal, right?

17:59.711 --> 18:03.082
Besides, it wasn't like
I didn't want to, so...

18:03.082 --> 18:04.071
Nina...

18:05.084 --> 18:08.087
O-Okay then, I'll do it! Ready?

18:08.087 --> 18:10.078
Yeah! Please do!

18:12.925 --> 18:15.260
Um... Do you mind closing your eyes?

18:15.260 --> 18:17.091
Huh? Oh, I'm sorry!

18:19.765 --> 18:24.169
Oh, my gosh! Am I really
going to kiss Zero now?

18:24.169 --> 18:25.500
Zero and...

18:27.773 --> 18:29.434
I...

18:32.778 --> 18:34.769
What? What happened?

18:36.448 --> 18:37.449
Does this mean-

18:37.449 --> 18:39.781
A progress in animalization!

18:41.120 --> 18:43.122
How do you like that, Zero?

18:43.122 --> 18:45.791
So what do you think? Look at you!
You look pretty desperate!

18:45.791 --> 18:48.293
Now do you feel bad about having
an affair behind my back at all?

18:48.293 --> 18:50.796
Give me a break!
Just turn us back to normal now!

18:50.796 --> 18:52.631
Well, let's see...

18:52.631 --> 18:56.468
If you insist, maybe I wouldn't mind
turning only Zero back to normal.

18:56.468 --> 18:59.138
W-Wait a second!
So what's going to happen to me?

18:59.138 --> 19:00.305
That's bullshit!

19:00.305 --> 19:04.143
It can't be just me!
Nina has to turn back to normal, too!

19:04.143 --> 19:05.477
What?

19:05.477 --> 19:07.646
It's pointless unless Nina
also turns back to normal with me!

19:07.646 --> 19:08.147
Zero!

19:08.147 --> 19:10.816
I've made a decision
that I'd protect Nina!

19:10.816 --> 19:12.751
I've decided that I'd never let
anyone take Nina away from me!

19:12.751 --> 19:15.320
What is this? Nina this, Nina that...

19:15.320 --> 19:18.157
Is she that important to you?

19:18.157 --> 19:21.827
Do you care about her that much?

19:21.827 --> 19:25.164
I do... I do...

19:25.164 --> 19:27.325
I do like Zero, too!

19:28.333 --> 19:29.823
Kuku-chan...

19:31.170 --> 19:35.507
It didn't matter if it was
a promise or I'm your fiancée!

19:35.507 --> 19:38.510
I just wanted to see you...

19:38.510 --> 19:40.913
So why that girl...

19:40.913 --> 19:44.917
Why can't you understand how I feel?

19:44.917 --> 19:51.356
If you... If you'll never understand me,
you should all turn into animals!!

19:51.356 --> 19:52.858
- What?
- What?

19:52.858 --> 19:54.860
Tarot magic!

19:54.860 --> 19:58.197
Animal change spread, expand!

19:58.197 --> 19:59.198
Huh?

19:59.198 --> 20:00.199
Huh?

20:00.199 --> 20:01.200
What?

20:01.200 --> 20:03.202
What is this?

20:03.202 --> 20:04.536
They won't come off!

20:04.536 --> 20:05.867
What's going on?

20:07.873 --> 20:09.875
Sensei, too?

20:09.875 --> 20:11.543
I don't know why, but I've got this...

20:11.543 --> 20:13.212
What?

20:13.212 --> 20:16.215
I've got this urge to wash something!

20:16.215 --> 20:19.885
Snap out of it!
You look like a raccoon, Yo!

20:19.885 --> 20:22.888
Yaay! That's a bobble!

20:22.888 --> 20:24.890
This has to be Kuku's magic!

20:24.890 --> 20:26.551
Kuku! Kuku!

20:29.895 --> 20:31.563
Hey! Nina-chan! Zero!

20:31.563 --> 20:32.564
We've been looking all
over for you zura!

20:32.564 --> 20:33.232
Ichii!

20:33.232 --> 20:35.234
Why are you two looking like that?

20:35.234 --> 20:36.902
What about you, Ichii? You're a wolf!

20:36.902 --> 20:38.570
For some reason, only Zura actually
looks good, don't you think?

20:38.570 --> 20:39.901
What?

20:42.074 --> 20:43.575
I'm handsome!

20:43.575 --> 20:46.245
Tell me what happened!
The entire school is in a panic!

20:46.245 --> 20:48.914
Shut up! If no one will
pay attention to me,

20:48.914 --> 20:50.249
I don't care about anything any more!

20:50.249 --> 20:52.751
I wish all of you would turn into animals!

20:52.751 --> 20:54.586
Kuku...

20:54.586 --> 20:55.921
Toto!

20:55.921 --> 20:57.256
You need to stop this.

20:57.256 --> 21:00.425
Kuku, it's pointless to do
stuff like this, you know.

21:00.425 --> 21:03.762
This isn't going to solve anything,
so you need to calm down.

21:03.762 --> 21:07.266
Shut up! You'd never
understand how I feel, Toto!

21:07.266 --> 21:09.268
No one would look at me!

21:09.268 --> 21:10.936
Kuku...

21:10.936 --> 21:12.267
Kuku.

21:13.605 --> 21:15.941
Don't tell me I wouldn't understand.

21:15.941 --> 21:20.946
Ever since I was little I've been
by your side and watched over you, Kuku.

21:20.946 --> 21:25.610
Even when you were chasing Zero,

21:26.618 --> 21:28.954
I was always...

21:28.954 --> 21:31.218
watching you...

21:32.624 --> 21:34.960
So I understand you.

21:34.960 --> 21:36.628
Kuku, am I...

21:36.628 --> 21:38.289
Toto...

21:39.298 --> 21:41.633
Am I not good enough for you?

21:41.633 --> 21:45.671
I can accept all the feelings
that you have right now

21:45.671 --> 21:48.640
and all the feelings
that you'll have in the future.

21:48.640 --> 21:52.311
So can I be the one to support you?

21:52.311 --> 21:54.302
Kuku, I will...

21:57.983 --> 21:59.644
Kuku-chan...

22:00.652 --> 22:03.849
I will be looking at you...

22:05.991 --> 22:07.826
Toto!

22:07.826 --> 22:10.989
I will always be looking
at you forever and ever...

22:22.007 --> 22:24.009
Huh?

22:24.009 --> 22:25.077
What?

22:25.077 --> 22:27.011
Oh? What happened to me...

22:28.013 --> 22:29.480
Swan!

22:32.017 --> 22:34.686
Thank you for everything.

22:34.686 --> 22:36.355
I'm sorry, Nina-chan.

22:36.355 --> 22:38.023
Oh, don't worry about it!

22:38.023 --> 22:39.991
So you are going back to the magic world?

22:39.991 --> 22:44.029
Yeah. I was never interested
in the sorcery test to begin with.

22:44.029 --> 22:46.832
Besides, I want to nurture
this new love back home anyway!

22:46.832 --> 22:47.699
Huh?

22:47.699 --> 22:48.700
Be careful!

22:48.700 --> 22:49.701
Take care.

22:49.701 --> 22:51.036
We'll see you again.

22:51.036 --> 22:52.037
Nina-chan, Nina-chan.

22:52.037 --> 22:52.704
Huh?

22:52.704 --> 22:54.873
I think you and Zero look cute together.

22:54.873 --> 22:57.042
Be sure to invite me
to your wedding, okay!

22:57.042 --> 22:59.378
What?

22:59.378 --> 23:00.379
See you later!

23:00.379 --> 23:01.380
Kuku-chan!

23:01.380 --> 23:04.049
Nina-chan, take care! Looking good!

23:04.049 --> 23:05.717
We'll see you again!

23:05.717 --> 23:07.119
Geez!

23:07.119 --> 23:09.454
What did Kuku say to you?
Spit it out, Nina!

23:09.454 --> 23:11.022
What? Nothing!

23:11.022 --> 23:12.391
Come on, what did she tell you?

23:12.391 --> 23:13.392
Nothing.

23:13.392 --> 23:15.060
Hey, say it, Nina.

23:15.060 --> 23:16.395
Hey!

23:16.395 --> 23:18.063
I told you it's nothing!

23:18.063 --> 23:22.567
But the truth is... that's what
I wish to see happen...

23:22.567 --> 23:24.569
Maybe?

23:24.569 --> 23:27.402
Hey, Nina, don't keep it a secret!

23:33.879 --> 23:39.215
Kuku... Toto... I hope that you
share a long and happy life together!

23:44.423 --> 23:47.259
Pit-a-pat, skip! Parallel pop!

23:47.259 --> 23:50.228
Pit-a-pat, step! Miracle kiss!

23:50.228 --> 23:53.254
Pit-a-pat, magical! Lollipop!

24:02.040 --> 24:07.846
My heart is beating so fast.
He might notice.

24:07.846 --> 24:13.652
My heart is pounding and throbbing.
It feels like it's going to burst.

24:13.652 --> 24:19.524
No matter which direction
I look, his eyes are crystals.

24:19.524 --> 24:25.430
They are so brilliant
that I just look away.

24:25.430 --> 24:31.269
The seed of love has begun to sprout.
Even my magic, too! Check it out!

24:31.269 --> 24:39.744
They will keep on growing
and spinning and explode!

24:39.744 --> 24:45.417
Popping lollipop. Save me, lollipop!
Throbbing heart.

24:45.417 --> 24:51.723
Two candies, I can't decide
which one is better.

24:51.723 --> 24:57.629
Even the earth turns the other way,
if you hold me,

24:57.629 --> 25:03.468
the shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat!

25:03.468 --> 25:09.065
The shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat! Lollipop!

25:11.510 --> 25:14.513
Back then, Sarasa was everything I had.

25:14.513 --> 25:18.517
I couldn't trust
any person other than her.

25:18.517 --> 25:23.188
But despite how I was,
he came right into my heart.

25:23.188 --> 25:26.858
What is this? What is this enthusiasm
that's welling up within me?

25:26.858 --> 25:31.530
His feelings have begun
to melt away my frozen heart.

25:31.530 --> 25:36.201
Next time on Save Me! Lollipop,
"Zero and Ichii -
The Meeting and the Bond!"

25:36.201 --> 25:39.534
Ichii, you're my only partner!
